      "key": "gg.mv.thompson",
      "title": "Thompson SMG",
      "tier": "MV",
      "desc": [
        "Fast, light automatic fire for crowds of anything. The Thompson keeps firing while you hold the trigger and gets through an SMG magazine quickly, so it shines at short range and runs dry if you waste it.",
        "It is built in an MV Assembler from an Iron Barrel, an Iron Receiver, a Wooden Stock, aluminum plates, screws and springs. It shoots the same 9mm bullets as your pistol, loaded into SMG magazines. If you want a bigger clip, look at the Mac10 next door.",
        "[note]Fire in short bursts and keep a spare magazine loaded.[/note]"
