    {
      "key": "gg.mv.mac10",
      "title": "Mac10",
      "tier": "MV",
      "desc": [
        "A compact automatic SMG with a thirty-two round clip. The Mac10 trades the Thompson's wooden furniture for steel parts: a Hardened Steel Barrel, a Steel Receiver and a polyethylene plate, plus aluminum plates, screws and springs, assembled in an MV Assembler.",
        "It uses the same SMG magazines as the Thompson. Two Mac10s combine into Akimbo Mac10s in a crafting grid, and the pair fires both guns on every pull.",
        "[note]The Steel Receiver is an MV part with its own quest. See MV Gun Parts.[/note]"
