    {
      "key": "gg.mv.parts",
      "title": "MV Gun Parts",
      "tier": "MV",
      "desc": [
        "MV rifles and shotguns are built around two new parts. The Steel Receiver (three steel plates, Mechanical Parts T2 and two aluminum screws) is a tougher action than the iron one. The Plastic Gun Stock (three polyethylene plates and two aluminum screws) replaces wood.",
        "Both are MV Assembler recipes, and NEI shows the inputs. Hold one of each to finish this quest. Polyethylene is GregTech's plastic; you will meet it in the oil chapters of the pack.",
        "[note]The M4, the Combat Shotgun and the Mac10 all use the Steel Receiver.[/note]"
      ],
