    {
      "key": "gg.mv.rifle",
      "title": "M4 or AK47",
      "tier": "MV",
      "desc": [
        "Assault rifles are the backbone of MV. Both the M4 and the AK47 fire automatically from a thirty-round Assault Rifle Magazine, which is not the same as an SMG magazine: each loaded one takes three Rifle Bullets, the same rounds as the bolt rifle. Either rifle completes this quest.",
        "The M4 has a scope (right-click to zoom) and uses the Steel Receiver and Plastic Gun Stock. The AK47 is cheaper, with an Iron Receiver and a Wooden Stock plus a couple of wooden sticks. Both use a Hardened Steel Barrel. Pick the one you can afford.",
        "[note]Assault Rifle Magazines have their own empty recipe in the MV press: three aluminum plates, eight springs and Mechanical Parts T2 make eight.[/note]"
      ],
