      "key": "gg.mv.combat_shotgun",
      "title": "Combat Shotgun",
      "tier": "MV",
      "desc": [
        "The big brother of the Sawed Off. Eight shells in the tube, and one reload tops up every empty spot with the same Shotgun Shells, so your LV shell production keeps it fed. Pellets spread wide, so it is devastating up close and weak at range.",
        "It is built in an MV Assembler from a Hardened Steel Barrel, a Steel Receiver, a Plastic Gun Stock, steel rods for the pump tube, and aluminum plates, screws and springs.",
        "[note]Reload between fights, not during them. A reload takes two and a half seconds.[/note]"
