    {
      "key": "gg.mv.akimbo",
      "title": "Akimbo",
      "tier": "MV",
      "desc": [
        "Two guns, one trigger. Akimbo Pistols and Akimbo Revolvers are made by combining two identical sidearms in a crafting grid. No machine is needed, and no offhand slot either: the akimbo gun is a single item that fires with alternating hands. Either one completes this quest.",
        "The pair doubles your clip, and a reload uses two magazines (or two bullets for the revolvers). Put the gun in a crafting grid alone and it splits back into the two originals, ammo included.",
        "[note]Two Mac10s make Akimbo Mac10s the same way, and those fire both guns on every pull.[/note]"
      ],
