    {
      "key": "gg.mv.grenades",
      "title": "Frag Grenade",
      "tier": "MV",
      "desc": [
        "The Frag Grenade is a hand grenade that means it. It blasts a radius of six blocks, and afterward sixty-four steel fragments fly out and hit whatever is in line. It is deadly in the open and up close, and a wall or another body shields you.",
        "Sixteen come out of one MV Assembler run: two aluminum plates, sixteen steel rounds and two TNT blocks. Hold sixteen to finish the quest.",
        "[warn]The fuse is six seconds, the thrower takes the blast like everyone else, and fragments need clear air. Throw from behind cover. Block damage is off unless the server turns it on.[/warn]"
      ],
