    {
      "key": "gg.mv.flashbang",
      "title": "Flashbang",
      "tier": "MV",
      "desc": [
        "Blinds and stuns instead of killing. Players caught in the flash go blind, then reel; mobs are slowed and weakened and forget who they were hunting. It does no damage and breaks no blocks, which makes it perfect for clearing a camp.",
        "Sixteen come out of one MV Assembler run of two aluminum plates, four magnesium dust and two gunpowder. The fuse is only two seconds, and a wall between you and the blast blocks the flash entirely.",
        "[note]Turn your back before it pops. The flash is strongest when you are looking at it. It affects the thrower too.[/note]"
